          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who this Limited Lifetime Warranty for Paint Extends To",
            "content": "<ol><li>This limited warranty extends to the original purchaser of any Paint. The “original purchaser” is defined as the first person to purchase the Paint from Gush who either owns or rents the property where the Paint is applied. This warranty is only valid for the duration of the original purchaser’s ownership or tenancy of the property. All references to \"you\" or \"your\" herein refer solely to original purchasers. Gush warranties are non-transferable. Proof of purchase is required to determine warranty eligibility.\n</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "d2834eef-5f1f-4ca1-bdb7-55253347c07f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "gush’s Limited Lifetime Warranty and Responsibilities",
            "content": "<ol>\n<li>\nGush warrants the Paint in its original packaging sold to you against the defects as defined in Section 3 below, for as long as you reside in the property, provided that the Paint is applied and maintained according to label instructions.</li>\n</ol>"
          }
        },
        "c93722ad-f5c3-4594-98c6-13a597fe7170": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What this Limited Lifetime Warranty for Paint Covers",
            "content": "<ol>\n<li>\nTHIS LIMITED LIFETIME WARRANTY covers the following:\n<ol>\n<li>\n<b>Peeling, blistering, and flaking</b> of paint from surfaces that have been properly prepared and maintained.</li>\n<li>\n<b>Significant discolouration or fading </b> not typical of the normal ageing or wear processes of paint over time.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>"
          }
        },
        "596cdd96-ea6c-497c-b3c8-18948f3c1fe0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What this Limited Lifetime Warranty Excludes",
            "content": "<ol>\n<li>THIS LIMITED LIFETIME WARRANTY DOES NOT COVER:\n<ol>\n<li>Expected colour fading, gloss loss, or chalking due to typical climate conditions (sun, humidity, rain, etc.);</li>\n<li>Damage from scrubbing, high traffic, or other day-to-day wear and tear;</li>\n<li>Peeling, blistering, or flaking caused by structural shifts, extreme heat exposure, or water intrusion;</li>\n<li>Mould or mildew growth due to high humidity, unless a separate mould warranty is awarded; or</li>\n<li>Improper surface preparation or incorrect application.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>"
          }
        },
        "text_g9amK9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Your Sole and Exclusive Remedy",
            "content": "<ol>\n<li>\nIf a defect is identified, Gush’s only responsibility is, at its discretion, to either provide replacement Paint or issue a refund for the defective Paint. Acceptance of any remedy by Gush Paint will fully settle all claims regarding the defect.\n</li>\n</ol>"
          }
        },
