          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Claim Process",
            "content": "<ol>\n<li>\nTo make a warranty claim, you are required to:\n<ol>\n<li>\nProvide proof of your original purchase (receipt/invoice).</li>\n<li>\nSubmit a detailed description of the issue, along with photographs of the affected area.</li>\n<li>\nAll claims must be submitted via email to hello@gush.earth.</li>\n<li>\nAdditionally, the Paint must have been used as instructed on the label, including proper surface preparation, sufficient drying times between coats, and using sealers where applicable.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>"
          }
        },
