            "content": "<ol>\n<li>\nThis limited warranty applies only to the paint itself and does not cover labour or the costs associated with paint removal.\n</li>\n<li>\nGush reserves the right to inspect the property before approving any claim.\n</li>\n<li>\nGush may conduct testing of the Paint to determine the cause of the defect before resolving the claim.</li>\n</ol>"
